            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina iyes kiwuapa ŋakiro ŋuna etubunitoe nu ŋikaru ka ŋikaru: Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon, elap ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei, emaikina iyes kiredakis akiron, ido nyitiyata etic edio; kiraakasi Ŋisirael ŋulu ikiurito Ŋisirael, kori ŋigelanotin ŋulu iboiyete kaapei ka Ŋisirael; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae eruwor akoloŋit ŋin ŋina ikimookunere iyes, ikitaleun. Iruworosi nai iyes ŋulu nyikitoroniyaritae alokiŋaren Ekapolon aŋuna a ŋasecisya kus a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae akoloŋit ŋin ŋina a Sabato, ŋina emaikina kieŋunere, ido emaikina iyes kiredakis akiron; erae ŋun ŋakiro ŋuna etubunitoe ŋuna a ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esacaradoti ŋolo adaun akios a akimyet ka akituruwor esacaradoti ŋolo Apolon nooi, ŋolo ilunyokin lorot a papa keŋ, iŋes emaikina kitiya amooki ka iŋes emaikina tonap ŋilowi ŋulu ke etal ŋulu amilimilak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido tomooku akibois ŋina Asegan nooi ŋin, eema ŋolo ilipere, namuroet, ŋisacaradotin ka ŋituŋa ŋuluce daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes torubakis iwuapito ŋakiro ŋuna etubunitoe ŋun ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. Emaikina iyes tomookete Ŋisirael a ŋolokaru aŋuna a ŋasecisya kec amookunet epei.” Abu nai Moses kitiya ŋun lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
